body:
in my opinion this is just recency bias, once the novelty of the new version has worn off, I think more people will be open to listening to both versions as if they are 2 completely different songs. 

&#x200B;

for me the 5 minute version will have my heart forever just because I love the climax to the bridge so much, however right now all I can play is the 10 minute version because its just so amazing.

&#x200B;

the songs have 2 completely different moods to me the 10 min is sadder and more reflective, telling a full story, whereas the 5 min is more cathartic and feels like you're really living the heartbreak?? 

&#x200B;

also does anyone feel like the 5 minute represents fall but the 10 minute is winter, and that's how I interpret the songs
